cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it as below, together with HoloOcean
  and DESERT Underwater, which provide the vehicle and network simulation.
type: software
title: "HoloOcean-DESERT: co-simulation of HoloOcean vehicles and DESERT Underwater networks"
abstract: >-
  Python library and web laboratory that couple HoloOcean 2.3 vehicle physics
  with the DESERT Underwater 4.0 / NS-MIRACLE network simulator running in a
  container. HoloOcean supplies the vehicle poses; DESERT executes the whole
  network stack (PHY, propagation, interference, MAC, routing, native traffic
  generators and ranging) on a shared logical clock. The project adds no
  network model of its own and records engine identity, effective
  configuration and native object values with every run.
